{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102004","id":2297871459,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6I9rxj","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102004","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102004.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102004.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102004","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102004/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102004/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102004/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/38fe344e4031ca20b2eca2cb168b00deb7b2012a","number":102004,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Handle shader includes as proper dependencies during export","user":{"login":"kisg","id":406832,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNjgzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/406832?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg","html_url":"https://github.com/kisg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Currently shaders are automatically included in the project export if the resource that uses the shaders is included in the export.\r\n\r\nHowever, shader includes (shader files loaded with #include directives in other shaders) are not handled as dependencies, so these files will get left out from the export unless explicitly included. Even worse: shader preprocessing on load is silently failing without any meaningful error message, so the user is left in the dark trying to find the cause why the shaders don't work in the exported project.\r\n\r\nThis PR enhances the shader resource handling, so shader includes are handled as proper dependencies and picked up automatically during export.\r\n\r\nThe commit also adds additional error reporting to shader preprocessing, so it is easier to debug shader preprocessing errors.\r\n\r\nDeveloped by [Migeran](https://migeran.com/).\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1609442062,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNjA5NDQyMDYy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:shaders","name":"topic:shaders","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2909900850,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyOTA5OTAwODUw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:export","name":"topic:export","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/